msgstr "Priame náklady na vrátenie veci budete znášať vy."

msgid ""
"You shall send back the goods or hand them over to us at the address above, "
"without undue delay and in any event not later than 14 days from the day on "
"which you communicate your withdrawal from this contract to us. The deadline"
" is met if you send back the goods before the period of 14 days has expired."
msgstr ""
"Vec nám odošlite alebo odovzdajte na adresu uvedenú vyššie, a to "
"bezodkladne, v každom prípade najneskôr do 14 dní odo dňa, keď ste nás "
"informovali o odstúpení od tejto zmluvy. Lehota je dodržaná, ak vec odošlete"
" pred uplynutím lehoty 14 dní."

