"The withdrawal period will expire after %d days from the day on which you "
"acquire, or a third party other than the carrier and indicated by you "
"acquires, physical possession of the goods."
msgstr ""
"Lehota na odstúpenie od zmluvy uplynie po %d dňoch odo dňa, keď ste "
"nadobudli vec do držby vy alebo vami určená tretia osoba iná ako prepravca."

